      "content": "hey so i think i might have actually seen marie antoinette in downtown chicago. i know that sounds insane but i saw this woman at a cafe today and everything about her was just... different. the way she carries herself, her posture, even the way she holds a tea cup. it was uncanny. i found this old sketch in a collector's shop yesterday that looks exactly like her but i can't stop thinking about this woman. do u think it's possible for people to just... stay around? like i'm not saying she's a ghost but i feel like i saw someone who shouldn't be here.",
